# Ignore-file for `docker build -f services/memory-service/Dockerfile <superproject root>`.
# BuildKit prefers `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile over the root
# `.dockerignore` (which excludes services/memory-service/ entirely, as it serves other
# services). Allow-list: only what the two-stage build actually COPYs (umbrella layout,
# TAI-ADR-0064).
*
!services/memory-service/pyproject.toml
!services/memory-service/uv.lock
!services/memory-service/README.md
!services/memory-service/LICENSE
!services/memory-service/THIRD_PARTY.md
!services/memory-service/src
!services/memory-service/client
!sdk/platform-auth-sdk/pyproject.toml
!sdk/platform-auth-sdk/README.md
!sdk/platform-auth-sdk/src
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
